rent one. Start new ya know? This dress is absolutely gorgeous and would be perfect for the beach or a vineyard or a field of flowers. Pretty much any beautiful destination wedding would fit this dress perfectly. It is brand new, with the tags, still in the garment bag, has never even been worn! I paid 1000 USD for it and I am asking 600 but I am willing to negotiate on that. I just want it to be worn and loved by someone! Here is a link to the website I&#039;m selling it, with pictures and I will post some here too! Please don&#039;t hesitate to contact me with questions etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/dresses\/view\/182363\/Wtoo-Alberta-Size-8.html&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/dresses\/view\/182363\/Wtoo-Alberta-Size-8.html&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":35888,"Name":"P7060449 (1).JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-213524-0-99667300-1465318389.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-213524-0-99667300-1465318389_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200},{"Id":35889,"Name":"P7060453 (3).JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-213524-0-19196600-1465318402.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-213524-0-19196600-1465318402_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":750},{"Id":35890,"Name":"P7060463 (1).JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-213524-0-94923400-1465318415.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-213524-0-94923400-1465318415_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":750},{"Id":35891,"Name":"P7060469 (3).JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-213524-0-22531700-1465318447.jpg","ScaledUrl"