sizes, 4 pairs - $5\/pair&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Never read\/opened - might be a good laugh for a groom-to-be - $5&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Never used - $5&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;$2 for set, only used the palm tree stamp.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Royal Doulton Cake Topper, never used, still in box &amp;nbsp;-$70&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Bouquet charm, fits Pandora bracelets - $10&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Lastly, my beautiful dress...&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Tons of Photos in album: &amp;nbsp;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18186]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Size 10. &amp;nbsp;Not yet cleaned, no alterations done except a corset added to the back which will allow this dress to fit smaller\/larger if needed. &amp;nbsp;Please msg if interested,&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914209,"PostDate":1465214823,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><strong>Misc Wedding Items for Sale!<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Would hate to see any of these items go to waste. \u00a0Located in the Etobicoke\/Mississauga area, could also arrange for a pick-up near the Eaton Centre downtown Toronto.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914209]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-39474900-1465231936.jpg\" title=\"Heart Cake Topper.jpg - Size: 96.12KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-39474900-1465231936.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Heart Cake Topper.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Used once for our wedding - washed, about 5\" tall - $5<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914209]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-47612800-1465231964.jpg\" title=\"Small Hearts Cake Topper.jpg - Size: 123KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-47612800-1465231964.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Small Hearts Cake Topper.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Purchased and didn't arrive in time for wedding - about 5 1\/4\" tall - $5<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914209]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-76148700-1465232010.jpg\" title=\"Centrepiece Light.JPG - Size: 127.78KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-76148700-1465232010.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Centrepiece Light.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bouquets used for centrepieces, 4 available, $5 each.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914209]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-90895700-1465232043.jpg\" title=\"Heart Vases.jpg - Size: 79.27KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-90895700-1465232043.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Heart Vases.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>5 available - $3 each<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914209]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-79224200-1465232119.jpg\" title=\"Bridal Party Games.jpg - Size: 93.95KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-79224200-1465232119.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Bridal Party Games.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Never used, opened to look at games inside - $3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914209]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-14267400-1465232144.jpg\" title=\"Bride to be Badge.jpg - Size: 101.48KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-14267400-1465232144.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Bride to be Badge.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Never used - $4<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914209]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-93047300-1465232170.jpg\" title=\"Feather Pen.jpg - Size: 113.92KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-93047300-1465232170.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Feather Pen.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Never used, still in box - $10<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914209]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-71938900-1465232199.jpg\" title=\"Foot Jewellery.jpg - Size: 107.75KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-71938900-1465232199.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Foot Jewellery.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Never worn, misc sizes, 4 pairs - $5\/pair<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914209]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-38186000-1465232227.jpg\" title=\"Groom Book.jpg - Size: 82.39KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-38186000-1465232227.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Groom Book.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Never read\/opened - might be a good laugh for a groom-to-be - $5<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914209]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-17114000-1465232368.jpg\" title=\"Small Frames.jpg - Size: 101.63KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-17114000-1465232368.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Small Frames.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Never used - $5<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914209]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-75665600-1465232458.jpg\" title=\"Stamps.jpg - Size: 143.61KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-75665600-1465232458.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Stamps.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>$2 for set, only used the palm tree stamp.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914209]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-79182300-1465232493.jpg\" title=\"FullSizeRender.jpg - Size: 100.21KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-79182300-1465232493.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"FullSizeRender.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Royal Doulton Cake Topper, never used, still in box \u00a0-$70<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914209]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-42713400-1465232580.jpg\" title=\"Charm 1.jpg - Size: 358.49KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-281751-0-42713400-1465232580.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Charm 1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bouquet charm, fits Pandora bracelets - $10<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lastly, my beautiful dress...\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>Tons of Photos in album: \u00a0<div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18186-our-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18186\/tn_gallery_281751_18186_29628.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='13173209 10153600228744142 750767878233219070 O'  width='75' height='75'  alt='13173209 10153600228744142 750767878233219070 O' id='tn_image_view_83190_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18186-our-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Our Wedding!<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>24 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Size 10. \u00a0Not yet cleaned, no alterations done except a corset added to the back which will allow this dress to fit smaller\/larger if needed. \u00a0Please msg if interested,<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421424569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1463440164","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":136,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.106.64.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80123,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9e529b09c2a306c1778e47edd2b6415e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Omg I&#039;m in love with the Royal Doulton! Not for a cake topper... lol just to have. I have other pieces but Doug would kill me.... we&#039;re supposed to be downsizing! But it&#039;s so pretty!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914233,"PostDate":1465302175,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Omg I'm in love with the Royal Doulton! Not for a cake topper... lol just to have. I have other pieces but Doug would kill me.... we're supposed to be downsizing! But it's so pretty!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80123","Title":"Misc Wedding Items For Sale","LastPostDate":1465302175},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
